title: "Linear Algebra with Python"
abstract: >-
  Seven practical assignments covering matrices, determinants, linear systems,
  and analytic geometry, with a Python reference implementation (linalg_utils)
  and a TypeScript port. Teaching material for Linear Algebra and Analytic
  Geometry (TSIW, ESMAD -- IPP).
